  "summary": "We at Openwave, utilize latest technological expertise and industry best practices to ensure that deliverables coming out of our premises are scalable and much reliable than what other development framework provides. You will be benefited with the right blend of cost-effective management solutions and innovative thought process we implement to create, build and develop .Net solutions and applications that supports your development as well as corporate workflow. Our services render improvised user-experience for our clientele.\n\nOur Specialized Service is Online Payment Portal \n\nOpenwave develops Payment gateway solutions that seamlessly allow third party payment gateways to customer websites. Enabling a website for credit card and online payment increases the chance of closing the sale and getting paid fast. We can securely integrate any payment gateway to shopping carts, portals or online application. Our Payment gateways will enable the customer to make payments using any method including:\n\nCredit cards\nE-checks/online checks\nPhone billing\nSMS-billing",
